<figure class="upgrade-walk lab wide" aria-labelledby="upgrade-walk-title" data-upgrade-walk>
  <figcaption id="upgrade-walk-title"><span class="eyebrow">Figure 1</span> Three binaries, one cluster version</figcaption>
  <div class="walk-output paper-surface">
    <p class="walk-stage" data-live data-stage>Start on v26.1.8</p>
    <div class="walk-nodes" aria-label="Node binaries">
      {['A','B','C'].map((name,i)=><div class="walk-node"><span>Node {name}</span><strong data-live data-binary={i}>v26.1.8</strong><small data-live data-node-state={i}>Original binary</small></div>)}
    </div>
    <div class="version-ledger">
      <div><span>Active cluster version</span><strong data-live data-cluster>26.1</strong></div>
      <div><span>Finalisation</span><strong data-live data-finalisation>Held</strong></div>
      <div><span>Return to v26.1.8</span><strong data-live data-return>Eligible</strong></div>
      <div><span>P7 catalogue price</span><strong data-live data-price>20.00</strong></div>
    </div>
    <p class="walk-explanation" data-live data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
  <div class="walk-controls">
    <label>After testing the new binaries <select data-route aria-label="Upgrade decision"><option value="finalise">Finalise</option><option value="return">Return to previous binaries</option></select></label>
    <div class="walk-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Figure 1 playback"><button type="button" data-play data-live>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step data-live>1 / 7</span></div>
    <div class="walk-hold" data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="walk-caption">A model of a supported v26.1.8 → v26.2.8 transition with automatic finalisation disabled. Each node change stands for a completed stop, restart and acceptance checkpoint. No elapsed time is implied. The running stage uses one observed intermediate version; the completed stage is a documentation-backed model, not an observed completion.</p>
  <details><summary>Both paths as text</summary><p>Initially A, B and C run v26.1.8 at cluster version 26.1. A, then B, then C restart on v26.2.8, while the cluster version stays 26.1. A separate committed catalogue update changes P7 to 22.00. Before finalisation begins, a rolling return can replace A, B and C with v26.1.8 while keeping 22.00. Alternatively finalisation starts internal migrations; the binary return closes immediately, although the reported version has not reached the final 26.2 value. An observed intermediate value is 26.1-upgrading-to-26.2-step-016. Completion advances it to 26.2. Order 103 remains pending, its agreed lines total 29.00, stock is 10/0/4 and no payment is added on either path.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
  import { stepper } from '../figures/stepper.mjs';
  const root = document.querySelector('[data-upgrade-walk]');
  if (root) {
    const route = root.querySelector('[data-route]');
    const base = [
      {title:'Start on v26.1.8',b:['26.1.8','26.1.8','26.1.8'],price:'20.00',text:'All three nodes run the original binary. The cluster version is 26.1. The operator has deliberately held automatic finalisation before starting.'},
      {title:'A has restarted and passed its checks',b:['26.2.8','26.1.8','26.1.8'],price:'20.00',text:'A runs v26.2.8; B and C still run v26.1.8. The supported mixed-binary state uses cluster version 26.1. Check A and the affected ranges before stopping B.'},
      {title:'B has restarted and passed its checks',b:['26.2.8','26.2.8','26.1.8'],price:'20.00',text:'A and B run v26.2.8. C still runs v26.1.8. A query entering A cannot inventory C’s binary: inspect every node.'},
      {title:'All new binaries, old cluster version',b:['26.2.8','26.2.8','26.2.8'],price:'20.00',text:'All nodes now run v26.2.8, but finalisation remains held and the active cluster version is 26.1. These are different version observations.'},
      {title:'The shop accepts work while held',b:['26.2.8','26.2.8','26.2.8'],price:'22.00',text:'A separate transaction commits the P7 catalogue change to 22.00. Order 103’s agreed mug price stays 20.00. Test ordinary work here; finalisation-dependent changes still need a later test.'}
    ];
    const endings = {
      finalise:[
        {title:'Internal migrations have begun',b:['26.2.8','26.2.8','26.2.8'],price:'22.00',cv:'26.1-upgrading-to-26.2-step-016',final:'Running',back:'Closed',text:'The version shows an intermediate upgrade step observed in the local run. Migrations have begun; the old-binary return is closed before the final 26.2 version appears.'},
        {title:'Finalisation has completed',b:['26.2.8','26.2.8','26.2.8'],price:'22.00',cv:'26.2',final:'Complete',back:'Closed',text:'The active cluster version is now 26.2. Inspect migration outcomes and repeat acceptance, including the release changes that needed finalisation. Recovery is a separate procedure.'}
      ],
      return:[
        {title:'A returns to v26.1.8',b:['26.1.8','26.2.8','26.2.8'],price:'22.00',text:'Finalisation has never begun. A returns using the supported old binary and the same store. The committed price remains 22.00.'},
        {title:'B returns to v26.1.8',b:['26.1.8','26.1.8','26.2.8'],price:'22.00',text:'B returns after A and the cluster pass their checks. Changing software does not reverse committed shop transactions.'},
        {title:'All original binaries, later shop data',b:['26.1.8','26.1.8','26.1.8'],price:'22.00',text:'Every node again runs v26.1.8 and the cluster version remains 26.1. P7 still costs 22.00. Verify health and the application again; the business change was not rolled back.'}
      ]
    };
    const states=()=>[...base,...endings[route.value]];
    const set=(sel,value)=>root.querySelector(sel).textContent=value;
    const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>states().length,draw:i=>{
      const s=states()[i]; set('[data-stage]',s.title);
      s.b.forEach((v,n)=>{set(`[data-binary="${n}"]`,'v'+v);set(`[data-node-state="${n}"]`,v==='26.2.8'?'New binary':'Original binary');root.querySelectorAll('.walk-node')[n].classList.toggle('new-binary',v==='26.2.8');});
      set('[data-cluster]',s.cv||'26.1');set('[data-finalisation]',s.final||'Held');set('[data-return]',s.back||'Eligible');set('[data-price]',s.price);set('[data-explanation]',s.text);
    }});
    route.addEventListener('change',()=>player.render());
  }
</script>
<style>
.upgrade-walk { padding:0; font-family:var(--font-sans); }
.upgrade-walk > figcaption { padding:1.1rem 1.2rem; color:var(--color-text); font-size:1.1rem; }
figcaption .eyebrow { display:block; margin-bottom:.35rem; font-size:.7rem; }
.walk-output { padding:1.2rem; border-left:0; border-right:0; }
.walk-stage { margin:0 0 1.2rem; font:600 1rem/1.5 var(--font-sans); }
.walk-nodes { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.7rem; }
.walk-node { border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); border-top:4px solid var(--stone,var(--color-rule-strong)); padding:.8rem .4rem; text-align:center; }
.walk-node.new-binary { border-top-color:var(--teal); }
.walk-node span,.walk-node strong,.walk-node small { display:block; }
.walk-node span { font-size:.78rem; }.walk-node strong { font:1rem/2 var(--font-mono); }.walk-node small { font-size:.75rem; }
.version-ledger { display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.7rem 1.5rem;margin:1.5rem 0; }
.version-ledger > div { padding:.5rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); }
.version-ledger span,.version-ledger strong { display:block; }.version-ledger span { font-size:.74rem; }.version-ledger strong { font:600 1.05rem/1.7 var(--font-mono); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.version-ledger [data-cluster] { font-size:.84rem; }
.walk-explanation { min-height:5em; font:.9rem/1.65 var(--font-sans);margin:0; padding-left:.8rem;border-left:3px solid var(--teal); }
.walk-controls { padding:1rem 1.2rem;background:var(--control-tint);color:var(--color-text); }
.walk-controls label { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:.8rem; }
.walk-controls select { max-width:100%;padding:.5rem; }
.walk-buttons { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;margin-top:.9rem; }
.walk-buttons button { padding:.5rem .7rem; }.walk-buttons span { margin-left:auto;font:.75rem var(--font-mono); }
.walk-hold { height:3px; background:var(--color-rule);margin-top:.8rem; }.walk-hold span { display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--control); }
.walk-caption,.upgrade-walk details { margin:.8rem 1.2rem;font:.76rem/1.65 var(--font-sans);color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
.upgrade-walk details p { font:inherit; }.upgrade-walk summary { cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline; }
@media(max-width:500px){.walk-output {padding:.9rem;}.walk-nodes {gap:.35rem;}.walk-node {padding:.6rem .15rem;}.walk-node strong {font-size:.86rem;}.version-ledger {gap:.4rem .8rem;}.walk-explanation {min-height:8em;}.walk-controls {padding:.9rem;}}
</style>
